<title>JAPAN: NCB bid-only in afternoon after tie-up news.</title>
<headline>NCB bid-only in afternoon after tie-up news.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Credit Bank Ltd shares were bid-only in Thursday afternoon trade after it said it will tie-up with Bankers Trust New York Corp, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0414 GMT, the shares were bid-only at 203 yen after closing at 168 yen the previous day.</p>
</text>
